msgid "More themes to set a CV in, beside Postulo's own: a CV laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "CV bat diseinatzeko gai gehiago, Postuloren berezkoez gain: Europass CVaren diseinua duen CV bat. Itzalita, gai horiek ez dira eskaintzen, eta horietako batean diseinatutako dokumentu bat gai arruntean marrazten da, berriro piztu arte."

